## Animation Lifecycle

Use GSAP context and proper cleanup.

Ensure:

- ScrollTriggers are properly destroyed.
- React component unmounts do not leave stale animations.
- Resize events refresh scroll measurements.
- Smooth scrolling and ScrollTrigger remain synchronized.
- Animations do not initialize multiple times.
- Route changes do not break animation state.

Do not put the entire website animation logic in one giant component.

Create reusable animation hooks or utilities.

