# 08. SCROLL AND PERFORMANCE ENGINEERING

This website contains complex scroll-driven animations.

Performance is a priority.

Requirements:

- Synchronize Lenis with GSAP ScrollTrigger.
- Use requestAnimationFrame appropriately.
- Avoid excessive React state updates during scroll.
- Animate transform and opacity wherever possible.
- Optimize SVG complexity.
- Lazy-load below-the-fold media.
- Use responsive image formats.
- Avoid unnecessary layout recalculations.
- Use GPU-friendly animation techniques where appropriate.
- Avoid excessive Canvas rendering.
- Respect prefers-reduced-motion.
- Provide simplified mobile animation sequences.

Do not sacrifice the quality of the desktop experience, but ensure the website remains usable on mobile devices.

Target smooth performance on modern desktop browsers.

